 {q:"Herzberg would advise a manager whose staff are bored but well paid to:", o:["Increase pay further","Improve the office lighting","Give workers more responsibility and recognition","Introduce a clocking-in system"], a:2, why:"Pay and conditions are hygiene factors. Boredom is solved by motivators — achievement, recognition, responsibility and the work itself."}
